{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"041bfa209c1bd8138686a87c00c5325476bd6721f47866508098b9a4f8ea9feb","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":20,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["露身赤脚的先知"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["亚述王撒珥根打发他珥探到亚实突的那年，他珥探就攻打亚实突，将城攻取。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["那时，耶和华晓谕亚摩斯的儿子以赛亚说：「你去解掉你腰间的麻布，脱下你脚上的鞋。」以赛亚就这样做，露身赤脚行走。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["耶和华说：「我仆人以赛亚怎样露身赤脚行走三年，作为关乎埃及和古实的预兆奇迹。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["照样，亚述王也必掳去埃及人，掠去古实人，无论老少，都露身赤脚，现出下体，使埃及蒙羞。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["以色列人必因所仰望的古实，所夸耀的埃及，惊惶羞愧。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["「那时，这沿海一带的居民必说：『看哪，我们素所仰望的，就是我们为脱离亚述王逃往求救的，不过是如此！我们怎能逃脱呢？』」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/20.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/21.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/19.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":6}